 clogs the guts of your station: will you exterminate it and preserve the station's work, even at the cost of your own survival?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231460/extras/f883dbdf2225846d523962df53f9f8b0.poster.avif?t=1787172881\" width=614 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231460/extras/f883dbdf2225846d523962df53f9f8b0.webm?t=1787172881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Are these worlds the same? When are they? <i>WHAT</i> are they!? Two distinct narratives overlap and mutate in a delirious genre apocalypse: <strong>adventure, visual novel, puzzle solving, survival simulation, and atmospheric horror collide to tell a story of escaping the inescapable.</strong>", "short_description": "A service industry adventure with an apocalyptic flavor. A manic genre mashup told across two broken realities. Step through the cracks: find your Exit.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231460/header.jpg?t=1787172881", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787172881", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787172881", "website": "https://serenityforge.com/games/roman-sands-re-build", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-equivalent processor or higher<br></li><